# Design (backend owner — agent owns visuals)

## Source of truth
1. `docs/TravelHub-концепт-для-заказчика/экраны` (01–30) and/or Figma MCP
2. Existing `designSystem` / theme tokens (navy `#12122E`, teal `#5DA9A4`, coral `#FF6B6B`)
3. Ignore alternate tab sets on individual concept PNGs — tabs are locked to 5

## Hard rules
- One job per section; brand/product readable in first viewport
- No purple-on-white / cream+terracotta / newspaper AI clichés
- Cards only when they hold interaction; no card soup in heroes
- Sticky CTAs use shared `StickyTourBar`; prices use `TourPriceLabel`
- Dark mode: text must stay readable (`theme.deep` / `theme.text`, never dark-on-dark)
- Mobile safe areas + tab bar padding via `useTabBarMetrics({ includeFab: false })`

## Process
- Before big UI: name the concept screen number(s) you match
- After UI: device/web check when possible; otherwise list what to screenshot
